# Build context is the repository root (see webapp/Dockerfile).
#
# Default-deny: the root holds .venv-win/, dist/, .git/ and the real
# webapp/secrets/idrac_password. An allowlist is the only form where forgetting
# to add a new exclusion cannot leak something into the image.
*

!r730xd_core
!webapp/requirements.txt
!webapp/app.py
!webapp/templates
!webapp/static

# Never, even if something above would otherwise pull them in.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/secrets
**/.env
